<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
	<title>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다.</title>
	<script language="javascript">
		function goKiprisPage(){
			window.location.href = 'https://www.kipris.or.kr/khome/main.do';
		}
	</script>
	<style>
		@charset "UTF-8"; 


		/* web font  */

		@font-face {
		  font-family: 'NanumGothic';
		  font-style: normal;
		  font-weight: 400;
		}

		@font-face {
		  font-family: 'NanumGothic';
		  font-style: normal;
		  font-weight: 700;
		}

		html {
		  font-family: "NanumGothic",  "돋움", dotum, Helvetica, sans-serif;
		  font-size: 0.813em;  /* 13px / 0.813em */
		  -ms-text-size-adjust: 0.813em; /* 모바일 가로 세로 전환시 폰트크기 확대 방지 */
		  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 0.813em;  
		  line-height:1.4;
		}

		body {background: #fff;color: #272727;}
		/* content-wrap */
		.breadcrumb {padding: 17px 0 6px;text-align: right;font-size: 0.923em} /* 12px */
		#.content-title {padding-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1;}
		#h3.content-title {margin-bottom: 20px;font-weight: 700;font-size: 2.077em} /* 28px / 13px = 2.154 em */



		/* 404 */
		.container-error-wrap {height: 100%; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;}
		.container-error {margin-top: 30px; margin-left:-50px; padding:0 0 30px 285px;background: url(https://www.kipris.or.kr/khome/images/error/bg_ki_error2.png) no-repeat 60px 0}
		.container-error h3.content-title {margin-bottom: 10px; padding-top: 10px; font-weight: 700;font-size: 2.077em;margin-top: 0px;}
		/* div group */
		.btn-group {margin: 20px 0}
		.btn-group-small,  .div-group  {margin: 10px 0}
		.api-group {overflow: hidden;}
		.bbs-group {overflow: hidden;} /* CR_YHY_20191204_001 변경 */


		.btn {display: inline-block;padding: 4px 5px;font-size: 0.923em;font-weight: 700;text-align: center;-webkit-box-sizing: content-box;-moz-box-sizing: content-box;box-sizing: content-box}
		.btn:hover {text-decoration: none}

		.btn-middle {height:28px;line-height:28px;padding:0px 15px;} /* padding: 1px 15px */
		.btn-large {height:33px;line-height:33px;padding:0 15px;}
		.btn-xxlarge {height: 40px;line-height: 40px;padding:0 15px;}
		.btn-wide {height:28px;line-height:28px;padding: 0px 27px}
		.btn-blue {background: #195ba7; color: #fff;}
		.btn-input.btn-blue {border: 0px solid #195ba7}
		.btn-lightblue {background: #7d9cd1;color: #fff;}
		.btn-gray {background: #f2f2f2; color: #000;}
		.btn-gray-line {/*height: 26px;line-height: 26px;*/background:#f2f2f2;border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;}
		.btn-gray-line.btn-middle {height: 26px;line-height: 26px;padding:0px 15px !important}
		.btn-disabled {background: #f2f2f2; color: #b4b4b4;}
		.btn-white-line {background: #fff;border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;font-weight: 400;line-height: 16px}
		.btn-white-line.selected {color: #195ba7;font-weight: 700}
		.btn-blue-hover:hover {background: #195ba7; color: #fff;}

		/* a Link style */
		a {text-decoration: none;color: #272727}
		a:focus, button:focus {
		  outline: thin dotted #333;
		  outline: 5px auto -webkit-focus-ring-color;
		  outline-offset: -2px;
		}
		a:hover,
		a:active {outline: 0;text-decoration:none;}
		a.link-blue {color: #195ba7;}
		a.link-underline {text-decoration:underline;}
		img {vertical-align: top}

		::-webkit-input-placeholder { color: #747474; }
		:-moz-placeholder { color: #747474; }
		::-moz-placeholder { color: #747474; }
		:-ms-input-placeholder { color: #747474 !important; }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
   	<div class="container container-error-wrap">
   		<section class="container-error">
   			<h3 class="content-title" itemprop="name">[원하시는 페이지를 찾을 수가 없습니다.]</h3>
   			<p style="font-size: 14px;font-weight: 400;">
				서비스 이용에 불편을 끼쳐드려 죄송합니다.<br>
   				찾으시려는 웹페이지의 이름이 바뀌었거나 현재 사용할 수 없거나 삭제되었습니다.<br>
   				입력하신 페이지 주소가 정확한지 다시 한번 확인해보시기 바랍니다.
			</p>
   			<p class="btn-group">
   				<a href="#" class="btn btn-blue btn-wide" onclick="javascript:goKiprisPage();">KIPIRIS 홈</a>
   			</p>
   		</section>  
   	</div>
</body>
</html>